v>\n                <div>7x24优先工单</div>\n                <p>遇到问题，第一时间得到专业响应。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"plans\" class=\"section\">\n        <h2>选择方案</h2>\n        <table class=\"plans-table\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>方案类型</th>\n                    <th>价格</th>\n                    <th>核心权益</th>\n                    <th>适合人群</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><strong>基础版</strong></td>\n                    <td><span class=\"plan-price\">¥15/月</span><br><span class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span></td>\n                    <td>\n                        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                            <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n                            <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n                            <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n                            <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>日常轻度使用</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"featured\">\n                    <td><strong>旗舰版</strong></td>\n                    <td><span class=\"plan-price\">¥35/月</span><br><span class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span></td>\n                    <td>\n                        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                            <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n                            <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n                            <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n                            <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n                            <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>追求稳定与加速的用户</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><strong>团队版</strong></td>\n                    <td><span class=\"plan-price\">¥85/月</span><br><span class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</span></td>\n                    <td>\n                        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                            <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n                            <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n                            <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n                            <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n                            <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>企业与团队级需求</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"faq\" class=\"faq-section section\">\n        <h2>常见问题</h2>\n        <div class=\"faq-grid\">\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">218222的流量如何计算？</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">流量以每月实际使用量为准，实时统计并以GB为单位呈现。所有方案均保证稳定传输，无隐藏限制。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">设备如何注册与管理？</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">支持多设备同时在线，通过官网或APP完成简单注册与设备添加，5分钟内即可完成配置。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">如何解锁流媒体服务？</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">旗舰版以上方案可实现全节点原生解锁，无需额外软件，浏览器或APP直连即可。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">团队版是否支持自定义路由？</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">是的，企业客户可通过专属客户经理申请定制路由方案，满足特定网络环境需求。</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer-nav\">\n        <div class=\"footer-content\">\n            <div class=\"footer-col\">\n                <div class=\"footer-logo\">218222<span>.</span></div>\n                <p class=\"footer-text\">专栏观察流量与连接的现实逻辑</p>\n                <div class=\"social-links\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"小红书\">小红书</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"微信\">微信</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"微博\">微博</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"foo